component, e.g. \code{GRP-01-0347504}. It depends only on the component's
membership, so rebuilding gives the same ids, and adding an unrelated group
moves no existing one - unlike a row number. It carries no other meaning:
the smallest EIN is often a member, not the parent. Use \code{group_central_ein}
for the parent.
}

